{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a challenging survival world full of dangers, discoveries, and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player survival game, your survival is the focus. Gather resources, build your own base, and craft equipment to face the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes \u2013 from scorching deserts to icy snowscapes \u2013 each region presents new challenges. The right clothing is crucial: a straw hat will protect you from the sun, while a winter jacket is vital in the cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned locations, loot valuable items, and face dangerous creatures. Firearms like pistols are rare but can be purchased from merchants for resources or currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to surviving, you can also build your own small farm: Buy animals from a merchant and breed animals to provide for yourself in the long term.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on your own \u2013 how long can you survive?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bear Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/349c3853ed6e0d1e45e85e589d227c2196968dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Bear Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/349c3853ed6e0d1e45e85e589d227c2196968dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Bear Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/349c3853ed6e0d1e45e85e589d227c2196968dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Helicopter Pilot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/102e8310f23c5695e56ec8a92ac9e33dc9dbdf9a.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/1ff615912410d2feeab3e0dc86a436ba92b2ab0f.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670170/1ff615912410d2feeab3e0dc86a436ba92b2ab0f.jpg"},{"name"